  "Q1|fx/widgets.md|A widget holds up to 12 things."
grade "kb-rooted citation resolves to the same file" 0 "3/3 passed" \
  "Q1|kb/fx/widgets.md|A widget holds up to 12 things."
grade "same-named file in another library is a wrong citation" 1 "expected 'widgets.md'" \
  "Q1|other/widgets.md|A widget holds up to 12 things."
grade "paraphrase of the excerpt is not grounded" 1 "excerpt not in answer" \
  "Q1|widgets.md|Widgets take a dozen items at most."
# The library given as a RELATIVE path: "." has no parent to anchor on unless it is
# resolved first, and a kb-rooted citation then failed while graded from inside it.
